{"ts":1783438802.4738379,"action":"foundation.evaluate.iterate","target":"canon/characters","detail":{"loop":1,"why":"The character bible only supplies one sheet — Carrie Vann, 34, a licensing/compliance professional who recommends buyout programs to families for a living — but the outline's daughter is named Iris, works in 'cannabis retail marketing,' and has no professional overlap with the buyout/consulting world Carrie's bio was built around (ch-10). Either two names for one character or two characters collapsed into one role; either way the daughter's job, motive for visiting, and thematic function (she's supposed to be the person confirming the industry commodifies craft) no longer track. Carrie's sheet also gives Wyatt a prior relationship as a childhood family friend who taught her to drive stick, but the outline introduces Wyatt fresh in ch-03 as a newly hired hand from a neighboring family with no established history with the daughter — a second, unresolved contradiction. Most critically, Ruth Vann, the sole POV character carrying all fifteen chapters, has no character sheet at all in this bible, nor do Wyatt, Denny Osgood, or Corinne Yee, despite each doing significant scene work. A single-POV literary novel living or dying on 'a life fully seen on its own terms' cannot be drafted on a character bible that omits the protagonist and contradicts itself on the daughter's identity."},"session":""}
{"ts":1783438985.34344,"action":"foundation.evaluate.iterate","target":"canon/world","detail":{"loop":2,"why":"No world content exists in the bible at all — the digest has Premise, Style, Open Threads, Characters, and Outline, but no world section. Everything the outline depends on (setback distances, the drying shed's proximity to the property line, an undocumented water diversion, a generator shed, track-and-trace requirements, retaining-wall costs, the shape of the county hearing room, how Canopy's footprint spread across three adjoining parcels) is only mentioned in passing inside outline beats, invented on the fly rather than established as canon. For a book this dependent on procedural, physical specificity — a style guide that explicitly wants 'soil, light cycles, curing, trimming, county code' over lyricism — there is no reference document securing that specificity. Compare this to threads (8 clearly named and each tied to an outline chapter) or outline (15 chapters with concrete beats): world is not thin, it is absent."},"session":""}
